silm:instances_papers_08_visual_discipline_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In '08ThesisConcreteAnchor1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the typed graph (G, R, tau) for the Mittens taxonomy diagram — nodes are Mittens, Felis catus, TSN 183798; arrows are classification-leg, taxonomy-leg, identity arrows." .
